# Cloudflare Pages reads this file directly (no build step needed) and
# applies these headers to every response. Phase 21's security pass.
#
# No Content-Security-Policy here on purpose, not an oversight: this
# site's Motion-driven animations (Hero's glow, MusicToggle's level
# bars, the ink/sword/flame motifs) render real inline `style="..."`
# attributes, which a CSP without `style-src 'unsafe-inline'` would
# simply refuse to apply. A CSP loose enough to allow that isn't
# providing much real protection, and getting a stricter one exactly
# right (WebGL texture data: URIs, blob: audio buffers, etc.) needs
# real testing against every animated component this site actually
# ships, not a guess. Left for a dedicated follow-up rather than
# shipping something untested that could silently break the site.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=()
